@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/projects

### Listar (view Resumo)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Filtrar com @RequestParam
GET {{baseUrl}}?tech=Angular&limit=5

### Detalhar (view Detalhe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### Id inválido (não casa com {id:\d+}) -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/abc

### Criar -> 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task Manager",
  "description": "Gerenciador de tarefas",
  "techs": ["Angular", "Spring Boot"],
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/exemplo/tasks",
  "yearsExperience": 1
}

### Atualizar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Portfólio v2",
  "description": "SPA com Angular",
  "techs": ["Angular"],
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/exemplo/portfolio",
  "yearsExperience": 2
}

### Remover -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/2
